OL,3,AResidents evacuated over unexploded WW2
OL,4,Abomb found in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 2,000 people from more than 300
OL,7,Fhomes in Falmouth are being evacuated
OL,8,Fas experts deal with a World War Two
OL,9,Fbomb
OL,11,FEmergency services were initially
OL,12,Fcalled to Falmouth Docks at 09:15 BST
OL,13,Fon Monday after the suspected 250lb
OL,14,F(115kg) American World War Two
OL,15,Fair-dropped device was found in the
OL,16,Fwater
OL,18,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone was
OL,19,Fpreviously in place which has since
OL,20,Fbeen expanded to 755m (2,477ft)
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
