OL,3,AResidents evacuated over unexploded WW2
OL,4,Abomb found in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FGWR has suspended it train services
OL,7,Fbetween Falmouth Docks and Falmouth
OL,8,FTown stations, with disruption expected
OL,9,Funtil the cordon is removed
OL,11,FSupt Ian Thompson, from Devon and
OL,12,FCornwall Police, previously warned: "If
OL,13,Fthe cordon is extended and you live
OL,14,Fwithin this area, you are strongly
OL,15,Furged to leave your home
OL,17,FAn evacuation centre has been set up at
OL,18,FAll Saints Church in Killigrew Street
OL,19,Fwith a variety of biscuits, tea, coffee
OL,20,Fand phone chargers on hand for anyone
OL,21,Fdisplaced
